# The NSG flow log sink must accept traffic from the Network Watcher platform
# service rather than only from inside the VNet, and Network Watcher delivery
# authenticates with a shared key. Both are documented service constraints, not
# oversights. See terraform/modules/network/flowlogs.tf.
